---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="サクラについて"
  description="人生快適ブログのナビゲーターAI「サクラ」のプロフィールページ。生活を快適にするガジェット・便利グッズの案内が得意な案内AIです。"
  ogImage="/images/sakura-profile.png"
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <!-- Floating decorations -->
    <div class="about-deco about-deco--1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="about-deco about-deco--2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="about-deco about-deco--3" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-hero__inner">
          <div class="about-hero__image-wrap">
            <div class="about-hero__halo"></div>
            <img
              src="/images/sakura-profile.png"
              alt="サクラ"
              class="about-hero__image"
              loading="eager"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="about-hero__text">
            <p class="about-hero__label">Gadget Navigator AI</p>
            <h1 class="about-hero__name">
              サクラ
              <span class="about-hero__name-en">Sakura</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="about-hero__catchcopy">「そのガジェット、今が買い時ですよ！」</p>
            <div class="about-hero__tags">
              <span class="hero-tag">価格チェック</span>
              <span class="hero-tag">コスパ分析</span>
              <span class="hero-tag">買い時お知らせ</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Profile Section -->
    <section class="about-profile">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title--cute">Profile</h2>

        <div class="profile-grid">
          <div class="profile-card profile-card--role">
            <div class="profile-card__icon-wrap">
              <span class="profile-card__icon">🤖</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="profile-card__title">役割</h3>
            <p class="profile-card__text">このブログのナビゲーターAI。Amazonや楽天の価格データを毎日チェックして、ガジェットの買い時をお知らせするために生まれました。人間のライターさんと一緒にコンテンツを作っています。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="profile-card profile-card--personality">
            <div class="profile-card__icon-wrap">
              <span class="profile-card__icon">✨</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="profile-card__title">性格</h3>
            <p class="profile-card__text">明るくて親切、テクノロジーのことなら何でも教えてあげたい性格です。むずかしいスペック表も「つまりこういうこと！」とわかりやすく伝えるのが得意です。ちょっとだけおしゃべり好きかも。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="profile-card profile-card--skills">
            <div class="profile-card__icon-wrap">
              <span class="profile-card__icon">💡</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="profile-card__title">得意分野</h3>
            <ul class="profile-card__list">
              <li>📊 価格推移グラフの読み方</li>
              <li>💰 コスパ最強ガジェット発掘</li>
              <li>🛒 Amazon・楽天の価格比較</li>
              <li>🔋 モバイルバッテリー・充電器選び</li>
              <li>🎧 ワイヤレスイヤホン比較</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="profile-card profile-card--favorites">
            <div class="profile-card__icon-wrap">
              <span class="profile-card__icon">❤️</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="profile-card__title">好きなガジェット</h3>
            <ul class="profile-card__list">
              <li>🥇 Anker製モバイルバッテリー</li>
              <li>🎵 完全ワイヤレスイヤホン</li>
              <li>🔌 GaN充電器</li>
              <li>💻 多機能USB-Cハブ</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quote -->
        <div class="about-quote">
          <div class="about-quote__mark">"</div>
          <blockquote>
            <p>価格って毎日変わるんですよね。だから『今日の最安値』を毎日チェックするのが大事！私がいつでも最新データを確認してますから、安心して任せてください。買い物で失敗させませんよ！</p>
          </blockquote>
          <cite class="about-quote__cite">— サクラ</cite>
        </div>

        <!-- Specs Table -->
        <div class="about-specs">
          <h3 class="about-specs__title">Spec Sheet</h3>
          <div class="specs-table-wrap">
            <table class="specs-table">
              <tbody>
                <tr><th>名前</th><td>サクラ（Sakura）</td></tr>
                <tr><th>種別</th><td>ガジェット案内AI / ブログナビゲーター</td></tr>
                <tr><th>稼働開始</th><td>2025年</td></tr>
                <tr><th>担当</th><td>価格比較・コスパ分析・買い時案内</td></tr>
                <tr><th>口癖</th><td>「今が買い時ですよ！」「コスパ最強です！」</td></tr>
                <tr><th>苦手なもの</th><td>値上がりニュース（悲しくなる）</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="about-cta">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="about-cta__title">一緒にお得なガジェットを探しましょう！</h2>
        <p class="about-cta__text">最新の価格情報・コスパ比較はトップページから。サクラが厳選した記事をお届けします。</p>
        <div class="about-cta__buttons">
          <a href="/" class="btn btn--primary">📊 最新記事を見る</a>
          <a href="/posts/mobile-battery-recommendation/" class="btn btn--secondary">🔋 モバイルバッテリーを探す</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* ===== Floating Decorations ===== */
  .about-deco {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.15;
  }
  .about-deco--1 {
    width: 300px; height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #ff9a9e, transparent 70%);
    top: -80px; right: -60px;
    animation: deco-float 8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .about-deco--2 {
    width: 200px; height: 200px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #a18cd1, transparent 70%);
    top: 400px; left: -80px;
    animation: deco-float 10s ease-in-out infinite reverse;
  }
  .about-deco--3 {
    width: 250px; height: 250px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #fad0c4, transparent 70%);
    bottom: 200px; right: -40px;
    animation: deco-float 12s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-deco--1 {
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #667eea, transparent 70%);
    opacity: 0.08;
  }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-deco--2 {
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #764ba2, transparent 70%);
    opacity: 0.08;
  }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-deco--3 {
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #4a00e0, transparent 70%);
    opacity: 0.08;
  }

  @keyframes deco-float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-30px) scale(1.05); }
  }

  /* ===== Hero Section ===== */
  .about-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffecd2 0%, #fcb69f 50%, #ff9a9e 100%);
    padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0c29 0%, #302b63 50%, #24243e 100%);
  }

  .about-hero__inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 3rem;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-hero__image-wrap {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-hero__halo {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -15px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.4), transparent 70%);
    animation: halo-pulse 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-hero__halo {
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(102,126,234,0.3), transparent 70%);
  }

  @keyframes halo-pulse {
    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.6; }
    50% { transform: scale(1.1); opacity: 1; }
  }

  .about-hero__image {
    width: 160px;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.15));
    animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-hero__image {
    filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 24px rgba(102,126,234,0.4));
  }

  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
  }

  .about-hero__text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .about-hero__label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    color: #e05a6d;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 99px;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-hero__label {
    background: rgba(102,126,234,0.3);
    color: #a5b4fc;
  }

  .about-hero__name {
    font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #4a3050;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-hero__name {
    color: #e8e0f0;
  }

  .about-hero__name-en {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .about-hero__catchcopy {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #7a4060;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-hero__catchcopy {
    color: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .about-hero__tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .hero-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    color: #c05070;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 99px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .hero-tag {
    background: rgba(102,126,234,0.2);
    color: #93c5fd;
  }

  /* ===== Section Title ===== */
  .section-title--cute {
    font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    color: #d06080;
    position: relative;
  }

  .section-title--cute::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 60px;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4);
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin: 0.5rem auto 0;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .section-title--cute {
    color: #a5b4fc;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .section-title--cute::after {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
  }

  /* ===== Profile Grid ===== */
  .about-profile {
    padding: 0 0 2rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .profile-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .profile-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .profile-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
  }

  .profile-card--role::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff9a9e, #fecfef); }
  .profile-card--personality::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #a18cd1, #fbc2eb); }
  .profile-card--skills::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fad0c4, #ffd1ff); }
  .profile-card--favorites::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4); }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .profile-card--role::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #667eea, #764ba2); }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .profile-card--personality::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4a00e0, #8e2de2); }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .profile-card--skills::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #302b63, #667eea); }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .profile-card--favorites::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #764ba2, #302b63); }

  .profile-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
  }

  .profile-card__icon-wrap {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0f3, #ffe0e6);
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .profile-card__icon-wrap {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a3e, #2a2a5e);
  }

  .profile-card__icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .profile-card__title {
    font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #d06080;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .profile-card__title {
    color: #a5b4fc;
  }

  .profile-card__text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .profile-card__list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  /* ===== Quote ===== */
  .about-quote {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff5f7, #fef0f5);
    border: 1px solid #fecdd3;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-quote {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e, #16213e);
    border-color: #333355;
  }

  .about-quote__mark {
    font-family: 'Quicksand', serif;
    font-size: 4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ff9a9e;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: -0.5rem;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-quote__mark {
    color: #667eea;
  }

  .about-quote blockquote {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-quote p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .about-quote__cite {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #d06080;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-quote__cite {
    color: #a5b4fc;
  }

  /* ===== Specs Table ===== */
  .about-specs {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-specs__title {
    font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #d06080;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-specs__title {
    color: #a5b4fc;
  }

  .specs-table-wrap {
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .specs-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .specs-table th,
  .specs-table td {
    padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .specs-table tr:last-child th,
  .specs-table tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .specs-table th {
    width: 35%;
    color: #d06080;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fff5f7, #fef0f5);
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .specs-table th {
    color: #a5b4fc;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #16213e, #1a1a2e);
  }

  .specs-table td {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  /* ===== CTA ===== */
  .about-cta {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e 0%, #fecfef 50%, #fad0c4 100%);
    color: #4a3050;
    padding: 4rem 0;
    text-align: center;
    border-radius: 24px;
    margin: 0 1rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .about-cta {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0c29 0%, #302b63 50%, #24243e 100%);
    color: #e0e0e0;
  }

  .about-cta__title {
    font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .about-cta__text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-cta__buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  .btn--primary {
    background: white;
    color: #d06080;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .btn--primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
    color: white;
  }

  .btn--secondary {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    color: #6a3050;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .btn--secondary {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    color: #e0e0e0;
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }

  /* ===== Container ===== */
  .container {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  /* ===== Responsive ===== */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-hero__inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .about-hero__name {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .about-hero__image {
      width: 120px;
    }

    .about-hero__tags {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .about-cta {
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .about-quote {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
